# The generators are LOAD-BEARING and must not be ignored.
#
# `_*` above was ignoring every one of them, so the site's walking pace, its stride constant, its
# length-drift check and the photo-credit builder existed ONLY on one machine. A fresh clone would
# have regenerated the site with the old, wrong pace and nobody would have known. That is the same
# failure as the auto-commit that reported "pushed" for months while pushing nothing: work that
# exists but is nowhere.
#
# Checked before un-ignoring: none of them carry a credential. This repo is PUBLIC.
